# Central Electrica 2F (C7, contract 53), 20 x 14, interior: the control room under the roof, the same steel plates and generators. Two scientists and FULGURION (L50, a legendary encounter (legend=) NPC; the legendary idiom replaces it) at the top (10,4). Stairs down (9,14).
@map central_electrica_2
@size 20 16
@interior yes
@area central_electrica
@bg 3
@fill metal_00
@flag fulgurion_gone 868   # Fulgurion was dealt with (won, caught or ran)
@encounters grass rate=11
  spoolt 36 40 5
  zaphid 36 40 20
  voltspool 38 42 25
  coilisp 36 40 5
  hoodcoil 38 42 15
  voltaboon 42 44 10
  coilet 36 40 15
  teslarch 40 44 5
@end
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 2 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 2 table=grass area=abcdghijkl period=1800
@spawn down 9 13 N
@legend
